[node name="BubblegumPops" type="Node3D"]
editor_description = "Bubblegum pops (Patterns): a pink bubble blown up behind the foot with a rubbery wobble, swelling to 1.35 times, bursting at 0.45 of 2.4 s into a flat gum splat and 5 shreds flying out at 0.8 m/s; 24 kept; the Clip stages the burst. placeholder: life, max_marks and every particle number are the old wardrobe.json / trail script numbers until the designer sets them; the meshes are stand-ins until assets/19's (core/144 judges the look on stills)"
